  <item>
    <title>Vol.13 串台《信日漫谈》—聊聊我和跑步的各种</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6475c92f53a5e5ea14785836</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6475c92f53a5e5ea14785836</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 May 2023 10:00:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上上周末，信哥闪现广州，约我录了一期播客。本播客一直是靠嘉宾输出，第一次以嘉宾身份聊，即使和信哥认识多年，也难免会有一些紧张，还请各位见谅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢信哥录制前后细致的安排，最后附上我们推荐的运动播客节目，希望有更多人发现跑步/运动的魅力！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">1:16</a> Alice开始做播客的心路历程；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="532">08:52</a> 用粤语录播客有差吗？Alice的粤语播客推荐：《好友运动营》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 近五年时间，全马430-&gt;301，NRC-&gt;广州黑马，Alice的进阶之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1075">17:55</a> 为什么会开始跑步？以及坚持跑步八年的心态变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1833">30:33</a> 离破三只差临门一脚，Alice的终极目标是跑马到八十岁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> 在开明的家庭，陪妈妈去跑马拉松是一种什么样的体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2723">45:23</a> 身边优秀的女性跑者，带给Alice的正向激励和感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2966">49:26</a> Alice在跑步领域的榜样是….「跑出巅峰」以及身边其他优秀的跑者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a> 从「理想的状态」聊到「理想型」的…表情包.gif</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a> 近十年广州跑步文化不断变化的个人感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3782">1:03:02</a> 在广州做严肃马拉松训练最大的困难是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3947">1:05:47</a> 如果换个城市，或者去做高原训练，会提高运动表现吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4242">1:10:42</a> 从跑者到跑步教练培训，Alice想要更多人跑的更科学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4440">1:14:00</a> Slow Down 跑步Radio名字的来源是哪里？如何「慢下来，去感受」？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4736">1:18:56</a> 不怎么关注装备的Alice建议大家平常训练少穿碳板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4937">1:22:17</a> Alice关于跑步，今年的目标和想法 以及传统的返场flag</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5115">1:25:15</a> Ending，最后想跟播客的听众所说的话</span></p><span></span><p><span>【跑步播客推荐】（不分排名）</span></p><span></span><p><span>信日漫谈</span></p><span></span><p><span>耐听</span></p><span></span><p><span>fit4life</span></p><span></span><p><span>跑步FM</span></p><span></span><p><span>能跑会道</span></p><span></span><p><span>杰克蜀黍的唠叨</span></p><span></span><p><span>跑步播客 Runner Podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span>—音乐：golden hour—</span></p>]]></description>
