    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Feb 2022 13:35:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播/运动发烧友- Alice</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾/STEPN社群助手&amp;资深玩家-Andy、Chester</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">1:22</a> STEPN是什么：web3链游，在solana黑客松游戏项目获奖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">2:50</a> STEPN怎么玩：选择合适自己属性和种类的NFT鞋子，开始运动吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="354">5:54</a> Andy成为社群助手的机缘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="731">12:11</a>“跑了就懂”：STEPN通过move to earn让大家迈出运动第一步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> STEPN未来会成为新的运动社交吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 让玩家获得健康的同时有不错的收益，与周边人的感情互动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> 关于游戏中的NFT鞋子的更多看法</span></p><span></span><p><span>——音乐：iKON - Long Time No See👀——</span></p><span></span><p><span>【一些背景】</span></p><span></span><p><span>STEPN的</span><a href="https://www.stepn.com" data-url="https://www.stepn.com"><strong><span>官网</span></strong></a><span>、</span><a href="https://twitter.com/Stepnofficial" data-url="https://twitter.com/Stepnofficial"><strong><span>推特</span></strong></a><span>（欢迎大家加入STEPN的discord社群与更多玩家交流）</span></p><span></span><p><span>项目创始人Jerry&amp;Yawn的播客采访节目：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61ea5376cdb3199f9a9cb092?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwNTg4ODc5ZTBmNWU3MjNiYjU3MGJmMSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61ea5376cdb3199f9a9cb092?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwNTg4ODc5ZTBmNWU3MjNiYjU3MGJmMSJ9"><strong><span>Move2Earn 应用 STEPN 的爆款之路</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><span>STEPN游戏中文文章介绍-</span><a href="https://www.theblockbeats.info/news/28361" data-url="https://www.theblockbeats.info/news/28361"><strong><span>如何在Web3 世界送外卖？用STEPN来「Move to Earn」吧</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><span>【额外提醒】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客中涉及的虚拟货币，NFT项目属区块链范畴，具一定的市场风险，不作投资建议，内容仅作分享交流。</span></p>]]></description>
